WEBVTT

00:00:17.270 --> 00:00:20.190
I'm Miwa.

00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:21.600
Miwa, huh?

00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:25.520
I'm Momo...

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:26.900
"Momo"?

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:29.900
Well, call me whatever.

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:33.480
How about... Momotaro?

00:00:36.020 --> 00:00:37.350
Okay.

00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:39.770
So?

00:00:39.770 --> 00:00:43.980
I was... molested.

00:00:43.980 --> 00:00:44.810
Yeah?

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:47.980
It was the same person every day.

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:51.770
One day, I screwed up
my courage and grabbed his arm.

00:00:51.770 --> 00:00:54.270
I shouted for help.

00:00:54.270 --> 00:00:55.650
Did it work out?

00:00:55.650 --> 00:00:59.520
Yes. Everyone around us pinned him down for me.

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:01.150
I'm glad.

00:01:01.150 --> 00:01:07.690
But why me? I'm not even that feminine.

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:09.560
I don't really get it.

00:01:11.020 --> 00:01:12.520
Yeah.

00:01:12.520 --> 00:01:14.810
I'm not, right?

00:01:14.810 --> 00:01:16.850
That's not true.

00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:20.270
Really?

00:01:20.270 --> 00:01:24.690
But that guy was an executive
at my dad's company.

00:01:24.690 --> 00:01:25.850
Huh?

00:01:26.850 --> 00:01:29.650
My dad got fired.

00:01:29.650 --> 00:01:33.270
My mom asked why I couldn't just put up with it.

00:01:33.270 --> 00:01:37.020
She said being groped just shows how cute I am.

00:01:40.810 --> 00:01:44.650
That he picked me because I'm so cute.

00:01:46.850 --> 00:01:50.100
Calm down. None of that is your fault.

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:52.100
It's not your fault, okay?

00:01:55.060 --> 00:01:56.650
Momotaro.

00:01:59.310 --> 00:02:03.600
Don't worry. I'll protect you.

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:05.020
Thank you.

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:06.350
Sure.

00:02:08.150 --> 00:02:12.190
You have broad shoulders.

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:13.690
Not really.

00:02:19.280 --> 00:02:23.950
Wonder Egg Priority

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:49.450
Episode 4: Colorful Girls

00:03:46.440 --> 00:03:48.350
Ai!

00:03:48.350 --> 00:03:50.150
We can't just run away!

00:03:50.150 --> 00:03:52.020
What else am I supposed to do?

00:03:53.020 --> 00:03:55.520
Yeah, we've got to fight!

00:03:55.520 --> 00:03:58.400
I can't in this mist!

00:03:58.400 --> 00:04:01.440
Besides, on my own...

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:02.730
Ai!

00:04:06.270 --> 00:04:07.310
Ai!

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:17.560
Ai.

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:20.730
Could you use this for something?

00:04:20.730 --> 00:04:22.100
Mine, too.

00:04:23.690 --> 00:04:25.310
Penlights?

00:04:26.940 --> 00:04:28.060
Thanks.

00:04:39.560 --> 00:04:41.190
This'll do it.

00:04:41.190 --> 00:04:44.100
All right! Come at me!

00:04:56.980 --> 00:04:59.690
You want me to touch you!

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:02.230
Adults can tell!

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:05.440
Tell me how much you want it!

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:07.190
Just touch your wife!

00:05:07.190 --> 00:05:09.980
You got married because you love each other!

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:14.730
Come out already!

00:05:14.730 --> 00:05:16.520
No thank you.

00:05:18.690 --> 00:05:19.690
Ai!

00:05:23.190 --> 00:05:24.480
Are you okay?!

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:27.190
Don't let your guard down.

00:05:27.190 --> 00:05:28.190
Oh, no!

00:05:33.150 --> 00:05:34.770
What'd you rather be?

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:38.230
Skewered, or turned to stone?

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:39.440
Neither!

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:41.770
Skewered it is, then!

00:05:41.770 --> 00:05:44.600
Females have expiration dates!

00:05:51.480 --> 00:05:53.940
Momotaro!

00:05:53.940 --> 00:05:55.230
Don't come out.

00:05:55.230 --> 00:05:58.850
You're a perverted brat who loves being touched.

00:05:58.850 --> 00:06:02.020
Come on; I'll make you feel <i>real</i> good.

00:06:02.020 --> 00:06:03.850
Bastard.

00:06:03.850 --> 00:06:05.060
Fine.

00:06:08.150 --> 00:06:09.770
You can touch me.

00:06:13.650 --> 00:06:17.190
Miko, Mako.

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:20.440
What's this song?

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:24.020
A real Yu-Yu fan couldn't skewer another fan

00:06:24.020 --> 00:06:26.900
while Yu-Yu is watching!

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:30.980
Ai, raise the penlights!

00:06:30.980 --> 00:06:33.440
Wave them!

00:06:33.440 --> 00:06:34.900
Don't be shy!

00:06:47.520 --> 00:06:50.350
Way to go, Mako!

00:06:50.350 --> 00:06:52.560
That's amazing!

00:06:52.560 --> 00:06:54.480
I've got to go after her!

00:06:54.480 --> 00:06:58.270
I was actually excited.

00:06:58.270 --> 00:07:01.350
It was, like, thrilling and suspenseful.

00:07:02.350 --> 00:07:04.900
Plus,

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:09.520
you did it because I'm cute, right?

00:07:09.520 --> 00:07:11.560
Of course I did.

00:07:11.560 --> 00:07:14.440
Finally, we understand each other.

00:07:23.150 --> 00:07:24.310
Ai.

00:07:26.020 --> 00:07:26.980
Yeah.

00:07:26.980 --> 00:07:28.600
Be gentle, okay?

00:07:28.600 --> 00:07:30.480
But of course.

00:07:30.480 --> 00:07:32.810
Come on, hands up.

00:07:34.900 --> 00:07:36.230
Touch me.

00:07:51.060 --> 00:07:54.310
Now I'm really mad!

00:07:58.440 --> 00:08:00.100
Get lost!

00:08:13.150 --> 00:08:15.350
You tricked me!

00:08:16.730 --> 00:08:18.900
Of course I did.

00:08:18.900 --> 00:08:21.060
I'd rather die than be with you.

00:08:23.560 --> 00:08:27.560
Women... are quick to deceive.

00:08:28.850 --> 00:08:31.230
Just kidding.

00:08:32.850 --> 00:08:33.850
Watch out!

00:08:36.730 --> 00:08:38.060
Idiot!

00:08:38.060 --> 00:08:41.690
Stupid brats are all just prey to adults!

00:08:50.100 --> 00:08:52.150
I'll hit you

00:08:52.150 --> 00:08:54.100
with a shot to the heart!

00:08:59.440 --> 00:09:00.440
Rika?!

00:09:03.230 --> 00:09:06.230
We're immortal in this world.

00:09:06.230 --> 00:09:08.980
So, we get fixed over time.

00:09:11.190 --> 00:09:12.810
Oh, yeah!

00:09:12.810 --> 00:09:14.480
Let's get this over with.

00:09:14.480 --> 00:09:15.560
Sure.

00:09:16.940 --> 00:09:18.730
We a unit again?

00:09:18.730 --> 00:09:19.850
Yeah!

00:09:22.190 --> 00:09:26.440
Don't you want to go colorfully?

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:30.270
Don't you want to go colorfully?!

00:09:36.560 --> 00:09:38.690
Take that!

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:47.690
And that!

00:09:56.770 --> 00:10:02.020
Ready...

00:10:03.020 --> 00:10:04.020
Go!

00:10:16.100 --> 00:10:17.940
You overdid it.

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:32.610
Out of service

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:32.610
Now departing

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:40.060
It was just a day, but I fell in love with you.

00:10:40.060 --> 00:10:42.100
Thank you.

00:10:42.100 --> 00:10:46.310
I'm really glad that I got to meet you.

00:10:46.310 --> 00:10:50.020
Can I stay like this until I disappear?

00:10:50.020 --> 00:10:51.400
Sure.

00:11:03.730 --> 00:11:05.400
I'm beat.

00:11:09.190 --> 00:11:11.980
Yeah! She's getting warmer.

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:15.310
We've become fans of you two!

00:11:15.310 --> 00:11:18.770
Totally! I'd come running to see your debut.

00:11:18.770 --> 00:11:21.770
No way. I'm not having a debut.

00:11:21.770 --> 00:11:23.770
We're your number one fans.

00:11:23.770 --> 00:11:25.600
Yeah!

00:11:25.600 --> 00:11:27.230
Bye-bye!

00:11:38.270 --> 00:11:41.730
It's just too soon to discharge you.

00:11:41.730 --> 00:11:45.230
Getting your muscles back in shape takes time.

00:11:55.100 --> 00:11:56.850
Thank you very much.

00:11:58.560 --> 00:12:00.520
You got out early, huh?

00:12:00.520 --> 00:12:03.230
Thanks to you and the Egg.

00:12:03.230 --> 00:12:08.440
It seems like fighting there puts
a heavy strain on our bodies.

00:12:08.440 --> 00:12:10.650
Like high-altitude training?

00:12:10.650 --> 00:12:11.650
Yes.

00:12:11.650 --> 00:12:16.480
Now you mention it, I think I've
gotten some definition on my abs.

00:12:16.480 --> 00:12:19.850
Why not join a sports club and test them out?

00:12:19.850 --> 00:12:23.060
Oh, but you don't go to school, do you?

00:12:26.310 --> 00:12:29.440
It's not like school is all there is.

00:12:29.440 --> 00:12:32.650
But my mom expects me to go.

00:12:32.650 --> 00:12:35.020
I don't go to school either.

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:37.190
And no one complains?

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:38.940
Not really.

00:12:38.940 --> 00:12:40.480
Wow.

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:42.100
Where next?

00:12:42.100 --> 00:12:44.900
I thought I'd go buy an Egg.

00:12:44.900 --> 00:12:46.980
Mind if I join you?

00:12:46.980 --> 00:12:48.310
Of course not.

00:12:50.440 --> 00:12:52.060
Neiru?

00:12:52.060 --> 00:12:53.150
Get in.

00:12:54.980 --> 00:12:56.980
I've got to make a stop first.

00:12:56.980 --> 00:12:58.770
O-Okay.

00:13:03.400 --> 00:13:06.520
Oh, yeah, about Rika.

00:13:06.520 --> 00:13:09.350
She's not so bad.

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:10.310
I see.

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:16.230
I guess she's contrarian, or her
attitude doesn't match her feelings.

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:18.770
Isn't she out to get her "wallet" back?

00:13:18.770 --> 00:13:20.190
No.

00:13:20.190 --> 00:13:23.810
That's just what she says. I think.

00:13:23.810 --> 00:13:25.520
Let's hope so.

00:13:33.100 --> 00:13:35.230
It's huge.

00:13:35.230 --> 00:13:36.980
Your dad's work?

00:13:41.600 --> 00:13:47.060
You're trusting, Ai. You forgive easily.

00:13:47.060 --> 00:13:48.850
You mean what I said?

00:13:48.850 --> 00:13:49.770
Yes.

00:13:49.770 --> 00:13:52.770
I guess so. I'm hopeless that way.

00:13:55.650 --> 00:13:57.270
You're lovely that way.

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:01.560
You're hopeless and lovely that way.

00:14:01.560 --> 00:14:06.100
We need someone like that sometimes,
or we'll never be saved.

00:14:07.650 --> 00:14:09.440
Welcome back, Ma'am.

00:14:09.440 --> 00:14:11.980
Okay. This is my friend, Ai Ohto.

00:14:11.980 --> 00:14:15.230
This is my first secretary, Misaki Tanabe.

00:14:15.230 --> 00:14:18.230
Hello, Ms. Ohto.

00:14:18.230 --> 00:14:19.770
Hello.

00:14:19.770 --> 00:14:23.060
Congratulations on your recovery, President.

00:14:23.060 --> 00:14:24.310
Thanks.

00:14:25.440 --> 00:14:27.060
President?!

00:14:30.150 --> 00:14:34.190
There are other girls tackling Eggs.

00:14:34.190 --> 00:14:36.060
Like who?

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:38.020
A sunflower, I guess.

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:39.520
Excuse me?

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:41.400
You'll see.

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:43.850
They're a bit eccentric,

00:14:43.850 --> 00:14:47.600
but they're all good kids. Try to make friends.

00:14:47.600 --> 00:14:49.230
A sunflower, huh?

00:14:49.230 --> 00:14:51.310
You've never eaten French fries?!

00:14:51.310 --> 00:14:52.150
No.

00:14:52.150 --> 00:14:55.940
They're crunchy and super
tasty when they're hot.

00:14:55.940 --> 00:14:57.940
Not so great cold, though.

00:14:57.940 --> 00:14:59.020
Is that so?

00:14:59.020 --> 00:15:03.150
Oh, but you know, there's a trick
to reheating them in the oven.

00:15:06.440 --> 00:15:09.190
This is a women-only car!

00:15:09.190 --> 00:15:11.350
Stupid man! If you want to ride, get it out!

00:15:11.350 --> 00:15:13.100
I'll chop it off for you!

00:15:14.730 --> 00:15:18.060
I have a right to ride on this car, too!

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:20.440
What're you trying to say?!

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:21.900
I'm saying

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:24.100
that I'm a girl, too!

00:15:25.850 --> 00:15:27.190
No way!

00:15:30.060 --> 00:15:31.400
Get lost!

00:15:34.490 --> 00:15:37.290
Out of service

00:15:34.490 --> 00:15:35.490
Now departing

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:36.870
Now departing

00:15:36.020 --> 00:15:38.100
Momotaro.

00:15:37.240 --> 00:15:37.290
Now departing

00:15:38.100 --> 00:15:42.440
My real name is Momoe. Momoe Sawaki.

00:15:42.440 --> 00:15:45.730
You're really a girl, right?

00:15:45.730 --> 00:15:48.810
I didn't mean to trick you.

00:15:48.810 --> 00:15:52.520
Don't you think a masculine
style suits me better?

00:15:52.520 --> 00:15:53.800
It doesn't matter.

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:54.600
Huh?

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:59.230
Even if you're a girl,
I've still fallen in love with you.

00:15:59.230 --> 00:16:02.440
I love you. I don't want to disappear.

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:05.230
I want to stay with you forever.

00:16:19.400 --> 00:16:22.690
Yeah. You're warm.

00:16:22.690 --> 00:16:26.480
There are more than you'd think, Haruka.

00:16:26.480 --> 00:16:29.650
Girls like you, who say they love me.

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:45.900
Touch me.

00:17:12.770 --> 00:17:15.850
I forgot my wallet.

00:17:15.850 --> 00:17:16.690
Would you mind--

00:17:16.690 --> 00:17:17.810
I would.

00:17:17.810 --> 00:17:20.230
You don't bring it on purpose.

00:17:20.230 --> 00:17:24.480
My daddy says a beautiful woman
shouldn't carry a wallet.

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:29.060
Plus, my little wallet's running late.

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:32.310
Ai isn't your wallet.

00:17:32.310 --> 00:17:34.770
I'm joking.

00:17:34.770 --> 00:17:37.980
Then stop. It's not funny.

00:17:37.980 --> 00:17:39.060
What?

00:17:50.230 --> 00:17:53.190
E-Excuse me.

00:17:53.190 --> 00:17:53.800
I'm--

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:56.020
Wow, you're handsome!

00:17:56.020 --> 00:17:57.730
Like a host!

00:17:57.730 --> 00:17:59.350
A host?

00:17:59.350 --> 00:18:01.520
So, there are guys, too.

00:18:01.520 --> 00:18:05.440
That makes sense. Boys kill themselves, too.

00:18:05.440 --> 00:18:07.440
Acca, what's going on?

00:18:07.440 --> 00:18:09.020
There should be no boys.

00:18:09.020 --> 00:18:13.190
Yes. Boys' and girls' suicides
mean different things.

00:18:13.190 --> 00:18:16.270
Men are goal-oriented,
women are emotion-oriented.

00:18:16.270 --> 00:18:21.060
Women are impulsive and easily
influenced by others' voices.

00:18:21.060 --> 00:18:22.690
Like human relationships?

00:18:22.690 --> 00:18:24.600
That's part of it.

00:18:24.600 --> 00:18:27.600
Imagine a "temptation of death."

00:18:27.600 --> 00:18:29.400
A temptation of death?

00:18:29.400 --> 00:18:30.650
Scary.

00:18:30.650 --> 00:18:32.600
But I think I kind of get it.

00:18:32.600 --> 00:18:36.440
Some might be led astray
by the temptation and regret it.

00:18:36.440 --> 00:18:41.310
This place exists for those who want
to return children like that to life.

00:18:41.310 --> 00:18:45.100
So, don't get hung up on gender.

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:48.020
Yeah, you shouldn't discriminate!

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:49.100
What?!

00:19:10.810 --> 00:19:12.020
Umm...

00:19:15.270 --> 00:19:17.100
Are you okay?

00:19:17.100 --> 00:19:19.770
Oh, I'm...

00:19:19.770 --> 00:19:22.230
I mean...

00:19:22.230 --> 00:19:23.730
I'm...

00:19:25.730 --> 00:19:29.400
Right now, how do I look to you?

00:19:29.400 --> 00:19:30.940
Huh?

00:19:30.940 --> 00:19:33.730
Like a crying girl.

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:36.150
Really?

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:40.980
A crying girl... who looks like a model.

00:19:40.980 --> 00:19:44.020
A sunflower.

00:19:44.020 --> 00:19:48.690
This? It's my favorite,
so it's practically all I wear.

00:19:48.690 --> 00:19:51.150
But...

00:19:51.150 --> 00:19:53.980
...it's really cute.

00:19:55.350 --> 00:19:56.900
Thanks!

00:19:58.600 --> 00:20:03.940
Models all have amazing contours
from their necks to their collarbones.

00:20:03.940 --> 00:20:05.100
You know a lot?

00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:07.940
A bit. I saw models a lot when I was little.

00:20:07.940 --> 00:20:09.100
Yeah?

00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:13.770
My mom used to be editor-in-chief
of a fashion magazine.

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:16.850
Oh! Neiru! Come look.

00:20:16.850 --> 00:20:19.440
Isn't her neck super pretty?

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:23.400
It's like a model's.

00:20:23.400 --> 00:20:26.400
You're right. It's long and slender.

00:20:26.400 --> 00:20:28.310
And no Adam's apple.

00:20:28.310 --> 00:20:30.900
You like Adam's apples, too, right?

00:20:30.900 --> 00:20:32.230
Me, too.

00:20:32.230 --> 00:20:34.810
I like Adam's apples, too! They're sexy.

00:20:34.810 --> 00:20:36.650
Aren't they, though?!

00:20:36.650 --> 00:20:37.980
They seem so firm!

00:20:37.980 --> 00:20:39.560
I know what you mean!

00:20:39.560 --> 00:20:41.310
I don't!

00:20:41.310 --> 00:20:43.440
How about my neck, then?

00:20:43.440 --> 00:20:46.770
Isn't it nice and inviting?

00:20:46.770 --> 00:20:47.770
Like a puppy.

00:20:47.770 --> 00:20:50.020
A puppy?! A puppy?

00:20:50.020 --> 00:20:53.900
Bow-wow-wow, lend me some cash.

00:20:53.900 --> 00:20:55.310
Dummy.

00:20:56.770 --> 00:20:58.270
Hey, don't laugh.

00:20:58.270 --> 00:21:00.690
But... Sorry.

00:21:13.060 --> 00:21:15.100
You're laughing too much.

00:21:15.100 --> 00:21:17.100
Come on, let's go buy Eggs.

00:21:17.100 --> 00:21:18.100
Sure.

00:21:18.100 --> 00:21:19.980
Hey, what's your name?

00:21:19.980 --> 00:21:23.900
Me? Momoe Sawaki.

00:21:23.900 --> 00:21:25.100
Huh?

00:21:25.100 --> 00:21:26.600
Sawaki?

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:02.020
Next time

00:22:58.350 --> 00:23:01.850
To be continued.
